  <p class="lede">Conventional processors and EDA flows pay a multiplicative complexity tax reconciling sequential instruction streams, MESI cache-coherence directories, tracing garbage collectors, and unverified place-and-route heuristics. Lowering Hyperactivity's degree-2 cubical interaction net directly to CMOS collapses coherence to a 1-word <code>vxchg</code> involution, heap management to a local LIFO conservation law, branch rollback to a 1-cycle §4.5 face-contradiction gate, and an <strong>18.66-million-polygon 16-tile 7nm GDSII die</strong> into <strong>5,386 bytes</strong>.</p>

