      <p style="margin:0;font-size:15.5px;">Verified by <code>vxchg-order-sym</code>, <code>beta-is-con-annihilate</code>, <code>dup-con-commutes-conserves</code>, <code>ucell-conflict-erases</code>, <code>steal-fifo-conserves</code>, and <code>quiescent-zero-inflight</code> — zero tracing GC, zero snoop traffic, and automatic GALS clock gating on empty deques (<code>gals-energy-saved</code>).</p>
