    <h2>2. Univalent Contraction of Physical EDA, Official 128-Bit EPFL Silicon &amp; Quantum QEC</h2>
    <p>Existing formal hardware frameworks (Kami, Koika, Wavelet, and Frostbite's Lean 4 RTL contracts) stop at RTL or abstract dataflow, handing gate synthesis, static timing, placement, DRC, and mask generation to unverified external heuristics. Hyperactivity internalizes the physical and information-theoretic stack inside one cubical kernel:</p>
